    "id": "usage",
    "title": "Animate with motion tokens",
    "category": "foundations",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "prose",
        "text": "Set transition durations and easing from the motion tokens, so a theme that retunes motion retunes your animations too. Ease something arriving on `--ease-entrance` and something moving on screen on `--ease-move`, so it follows the theme's `character`, and something leaving on `--ease-exit`, which stays the same at every `character`."
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "lang": "tsx",
        "code": "import {durationVars, easeVars} from '@astryxdesign/core/theme/tokens.stylex';\n\nconst styles = stylex.create({\n  fadeIn: {\n    transitionProperty: 'opacity',\n    transitionDuration: durationVars['--duration-fast'],\n    transitionTimingFunction: easeVars['--ease-standard'],\n  },\n  slideUp: {\n    transitionProperty: 'transform, opacity',\n    transitionDuration: durationVars['--duration-medium'],\n    transitionTimingFunction: easeVars['--ease-entrance'],\n  },\n});",
        "label": "Applying motion tokens"
      }
    ],
    "links": {
      "up": "astryx docs motion --index",
